<p>You fire a shot for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">117%, 125%, 130%, 135%, 140%</acronym> damage that attempts to pin your target to the ground for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 5</acronym> turns, as well as giving your next Steady Shot or Shoot 100% increased chance to critically hit and mark (regardless of whether the pin succeeds).</p><p>This shot has a 20% chance to mark the target.</p><p>The chance to pin increases with your Accuracy.</p>